Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.26,0:00:05.50,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Medvedev claims a third title of the season.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N梅德韦杰夫收获本赛季第三冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:08.44,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}9{\fs68}月{\fs78}29{\fs68}号晚上快{\fs78}8{\fs68}点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.44,0:00:09.77,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}杭州决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.77,0:00:12.76,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}梅德韦杰夫两盘拿下卢布列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:14.43,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}但首盘并不轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.43,0:00:16.77,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}两人一路打到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:19.49,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这个回合 卢布列夫持续调动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.49,0:00:22.72,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}梅德韦杰夫接住攻势 再往网前压
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.90,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}拿下这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:26.51,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}压力回到卢布列夫的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.51,0:00:28.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}全场面对两个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:30.65,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他全部守住 发球局一个没丢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:33.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}还轰出了{\fs78}23{\fs68}记{\fs78}ACE{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:40.38,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}同一局 梅德韦杰夫拿到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.38,0:00:43.73,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}相持之后 他先完成破发 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.73,0:00:45.28,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}从{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}的僵局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:47.14,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}到自己的发球胜盘局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.14,0:00:49.27,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这一步非常关键
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:53.25,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}再守住这一局 {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.25,0:00:57.06,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首盘最后两局 梅德韦杰夫都拿下了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:00:59.61,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二盘开局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.61,0:01:02.29,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}卢布列夫的发球局又遇到麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.29,0:01:05.13,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}梅德韦杰夫再次破发 {\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.13,0:01:06.62,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首盘末段的优势
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:08.96,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}就这样接到了第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.46,0:01:21.42,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Medvedev claims a third title of the season.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N梅德韦杰夫收获本赛季第三冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.42,0:01:27.08,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He boosts his chances of qualifying for Turin in the process.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他也提高了入围年终总决赛的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.08,0:01:33.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Once again he gets the better of his good friend Andrey Rublev in straight sets.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他再次直落两盘击败好友卢布列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.70,0:01:35.31,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.31,0:01:38.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}杭州的奖杯属于梅德韦杰夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.10,0:01:40.07,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这是他生涯第{\fs78}24{\fs68}冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.07,0:01:42.03,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}也是本赛季第三冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.03,0:01:43.71,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}接下来的亚洲赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.71,0:01:45.91,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他还能再拿一座吗？
